  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant contract to provide competent, transparent, effective and accountable civil society serving people who use drugs in Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the action is: strengthening the capacities of civil society, promoting the role of competent, transparent, effective and accountable actors in providing social services and promoting innovative approaches to persons who use drugs, with a special focus on the ones affected by the COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
